{'symbol': 'CVX', 'date': '2021-10-27 16:30:00', 'title': 'CHEVRON ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "SAN RAMON, CALIF.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CHEVRON CORPORATION (NYSE: CVX) DECLARED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND OF ONE DOLLAR AND THIRTY-FOUR CENTS ($1.34) PER SHARE, PAYABLE DECEMBER 10, 2021, TO ALL HOLDERS OF COMMON STOCK AS SHOWN ON THE TRANSFER RECORDS OF THE CORPORATION AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS NOVEMBER 18, 2021. CHEVRON IS ONE OF THE WORLD'S LEADING INTEGRATED ENERGY COMPANIES. WE BELIEVE AFFORDABLE, RELIABLE AND EVER-CLEANER ENERGY IS ESSENTIAL TO ACHIEVING A MORE PROSPEROUS"}